Download it: The feature is available to everyone via the Web now, and[ is in the process of] rolling out to the Android and iOS apps. Still, whether you’re on a desktop of smartphone, you can go ahead download your data by inputting your account information here. Keep[ in] mind it[ takes] some time for Instagram to[ am]ass all your data; the company says the process may[ take] ‘up to 48 hours.’ After that’s[ complete], you’ll receive a link at the provided email address.[]

